  <p id="c-nanshi-077-kongfan-family-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-077-kongfan-family-context:p001:m0000" ref="qid_wbb_2pi_AAA">孔範</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-077-kongfan-family-context:p001:m0003" ref="qid_wbb_2pi_AAA">法言</persName>，會稽山陰人也。曾祖<persName id="c-nanshi-077-kongfan-family-context:p001:m0015" ref="qid_wbb_2pi">景偉</persName>，齊散騎常侍。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-077-kongfan-family-context:p001:m0025" ref="qid_wbb_2pi_A">滔</persName>，梁海鹽令。父<persName id="c-nanshi-077-kongfan-family-context:p001:m0033" ref="qid_wbb_2pi_AA">岱</persName>，曆職清顯。</p>
